  "description": {
    "text": "The Cobalion deck of the Battle Strength Decks, three Japanese half decks released together on 18 March 2011 (Virizion, Terrakion and Cobalion) for players who had learned the game and wanted to battle better. Each held a 30-card half deck and three Battle Strength holo cards to swap in and strengthen it, among them the Legendary Pokémon Cobalion and Bianca, the childhood friend from Pokémon Black and White, with a strengthening guide and a quick guide. Zoroark and Klang back it up, on Metal and Darkness Energy."
  },
